a zenze olu tshintsho.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L1","label":"Literal","band":"lower"}},{"question":"Igama kuphela linegalelo lini kwibango?","options":["Libonisa ukungaqiniseki okufanelekileyo.","Lithetha ukuba kukho izizathu ezininzi.","Lisusa naluphi na uthelekiso.","Lenza ibango lobangela libe ngqongqo kakhulu."],"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Kuphela likhupha ezinye iinkcazelo. Elo bango lifuna ubungqina obomeleleyo bokwahlula ifuthe lezinye izinto.","stimulus":"Ingxelo ithi ukusetyenziswa kwethala kunyuke nge-20% emva kokwandiswa kweeyure. Kwangelo xesha kwangeniswa iincwadi ezintsha kwaza kwaqalwa iklabhu yokufunda. Ingxelo ithi iiyure ezinde kuphela zenze olu tshintsho.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L3","label":"Inference","band":"middle"}},{"question":"Kutheni ixesha lokuthathwa kwefoto libalulekile?","options":["Zonke iifoto zingqina zonke izihloko.","Ixesha alinakuchaphazela intsingiselo.","Ifoto yangaphambi kokuvulwa ayingqini ukusetyenziswa ngexesha lokusebenza.","Ifoto ibonisa onke amava abafundi."],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Umfanekiso ufuna umxholo wexesha nendawo. Ngaphandle kwawo, unokunika umfanekiso olahlekisayo.","stimulus":"Isihloko sithi: Abafundi abangamavila abalisebenzisi ithala. Ifoto yezitulo ezingenabantu yathathwa ngaphambi kokuvulwa. Ingxelo ayiquki amazwi abafundi abangenazithuthi emva kwemini.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L4","label":"Evaluation","band":"higher"}},{"question":"Loluphi ulwazi olushiyiweyo olubalulekileyo?","options":["Inkampani eyenze izitulo.","Umbala wepeni yentatheli.","Ubukhulu belogo yethala.","Amava abafundi abanengxaki yokuthutha."],"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Ukuthutha kuchaphazela ukufikelela ngqo. Ukushiya elo lizwi ngaphandle kunokwenza ingxelo ingalingani.","stimulus":"Isihloko sithi: Abafundi abangamavila abalisebenzisi ithala. Ifoto yezitulo ezingenabantu yathathwa ngaphambi kokuvulwa. Ingxelo ayiquki amazwi abafundi abangenazithuthi emva kwemini.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L1","label":"Literal","band":"lower"}},{"question":"Ngaba ukutshintsha abangamavila kube abangekho kuyayilungisa yonke ingxelo?","options":["Ewe; zonke iingxaki zobungqina ziphela ngegama elinye.","Hayi; ixesha lefoto alibalulekanga.","Hayi; umxholo wefoto namazwi abafundi abanengxaki yezithuthi asafuneka.","Ewe; izihloko azidingi bungqina."],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Ukususa isigwebo esibi kunceda, kodwa akulungisi ifoto elahlekisayo nokushiywa kwelizwi elibalulekileyo. Ingxelo elungeleleneyo ifuna umxholo nobungqina obaneleyo.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L4","label":"Evaluation","band":"higher"},"stimulus":"Isihloko sithi: Abafundi abangamavila abalisebenzisi ithala. Ifoto yezitulo ezingenabantu yathathwa ngaphambi kokuvulwa. Ingxelo ayiquki amazwi abafundi abangenazithuthi emva kwemini."}],"created_by":"SmartBridge FET content team","is_published":true,"description":"Mixed grade revision drawn from the other two terms. Includes later-term topics; revisit after studying those topics. Questions are reused deliberately across revision sets.","quiz_type":"practice","difficulty_level":"medium","time_limit_minutes":12,"passing_score_percentage":50,"total_questions":5,"allow_retakes":true,"show_answers_after_submission":true,"tags":["CAPS","ATP","term-4","formative","xhhl"],"metadata":{"term":4,"focus":"Mixed revision: Ubungqina, uthelekiso nezigqibo; Ukukhethwa kwamagama nokushiywa kolwazi","language":"xh","content_version":"2026-10-21.2","content_origin":"SmartBridge original","curriculum_year":2026,"atp_url":"https://www.education.gov.za/LinkClick.aspx?fileticket=sJ87UYZMguI%3d&tabid=3205&portalid=0&mid=10756","caps_url":"https://www.education.gov.za/LinkClick.aspx?fileticket=QsGQeCZMUxo%3d&tabid=570&portalid=0&mid=1555","retention_circular_url":"https://www.education.gov.za/Portals/0/Documents/Publications/2026/Circulars/Circular%20S19%20of%202025%20and%20Annexures.pdf","verified_on":"2026-10-21","lesson_path":"/study-packs/xhhl-12","coverage":"Selected grade revision from other terms, including later-term content. Not a second paper covering only the selected term.","moderation_status":"Independent teacher and language moderation pending","term_note":"Revision included where specified by ATP; some Grade 10/11 Term 4 plans introduce new content.","set_id":"B","set_label":"Mixed grade revision","cognitive_framework":"CAPS language response: Barrett-informed comprehension and literary analysis","cognitive_levels":["Literal","Reorganisation","Inference","Evaluation","Appreciation"],"classification_status":"Draft author classification; independent moderation pending","assessment_note":"Five-question formative samples do not reproduce formal examination mark weightings or assess extended written responses.","source_terms":[2,3],"atp_urls":["https://www.education.gov.za/LinkClick.aspx?fileticket=sJ87UYZMguI%3d&tabid=3205&portalid=0&mid=10756"],"question_reuse":"Revision questions recur across term-focused and mixed sets; Set A and Set B within the same selection do not share questions."}},{"id":"8f232f68-4eed-5120-a74f-08ee729ad639","title":"isiZulu HL · Grade 12 · Term 2 selection · Set B: Mixed revision","subject":"isiZulu HL","grade":"Grade 12","questions":[{"question":"Igama abangamavila linamuphi umthelela?","options":["Linikeza isilinganiso esicacile sesikhathi.","Lifakazela ukuthi wonke umfundi uqamba amanga.","Liholela esahlulelweni esibi ngaphambi kokuhlola izimo.","Lichaza indawo yomtapo kuphela."],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Leli gama lithwele umuzwa wokugxeka ngaphandle kobufakazi obanele bezizathu zabafundi.","stimulus":"Isihloko sithi: Abafundi abangamavila abawusebenzisi umtapo. Isithombe sezihlalo ezingenabantu sathathwa ngaphambi kokuvula. Umbiko awuwafaki amazwi abafundi abangenazo izinto zokuthutha ntambama.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L5","label":"Appreciation","band":"higher"}},{"question":"Yisiphi isihloko esilinganiselayo?","options":["Bonke abafundi bayenqaba ukufunda.","Ukusetshenziswa komtapo kuvusa imibuzo ngokufinyelela.","Izihlalo ezingenabantu zifakazela ubuvila.","Ezokuthutha azithinti muntu."],"correct_index":1,"explanation":"Isihloko sikhomba umbuzo ongaphenywa ngaphandle kokwahlulela izizathu zabantu ezingakahlolwa.","stimulus":"Isihloko sithi: Abafundi abangamavila abawusebenzisi umtapo. Isithombe sezihlalo ezingenabantu sathathwa ngaphambi kokuvula. Umbiko awuwafaki amazwi abafundi abangenazo izinto zokuthutha ntambama.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L4","label":"Evaluation","band":"higher"}},{"question":"Ukuchaza isitimela njengesisxhamazelayo kuyini?","options":["Ukwenza samuntu","Iresiphi","Uhlu lwamanani","Imiyalelo yokwakha"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Isitimela sinikwa isici somuntu. Lokhu kungadala umuzwa wokuphuthuma ohlukile ekungabazeni kukaNoma.","stimulus":"Esiteshini uNoma uvula incwadi futhi. Isitimela siyangena, sixhamazela futhi sikhanya. Ufaka incwadi ephaketheni ahlehle, kuyilapho abanye beya phambili.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L1","label":"Literal","band":"lower"}},{"question":"Yisiphi isiphetho esigcina imikhawulo yombhalo?","options":["Incwadi imxosha emsebenzini ngokuqinisekile.","Ukuvula incwadi futhi nokuhlehla kungasikisela ukungaqiniseki ngokuhamba.","UNoma akakaze agibele isitimela.","Bonke abantu bayakwazi okubhalwe encwadini."],"correct_index":1,"explanation":"Umbhalo unikeza izinkomba kodwa awukuvezi okuqukethwe incwadi noma wonke umlando womlingiswa.","stimulus":"Esiteshini uNoma uvula incwadi futhi. Isitimela siyangena, sixhamazela futhi sikhanya. Ufaka incwadi ephaketheni ahlehle, kuyilapho abanye beya phambili.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L3","label":"Inference","band":"middle"}},{"question":"Ukuxhamazela kwesitimela kunamuphi umthelela uma kuqhathaniswa nokuhlehla kukaNoma?","options":["Kufakazela konke okubhalwe encwadini.","Kubonisa ukuthi isitimela singumuntu wangempela.","Kwandisa ukungezwani phakathi kokuya phambili nokungaqiniseki kwakhe.","Kufakazela ukuthi ngeke ahambe nanini."],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"Ukwenza samuntu kwakha umuzwa wokuphuthuma. Isenzo sikaNoma esiphikisayo sakha ukungezwani, kodwa asisiniki isinqumo sakhe sokugcina.","cognitive_level":{"code":"L4","label":"Evaluation","band":"higher"},"stimulus":"Esiteshini uNoma uvula incwadi futhi. Isitimela siyangena, sixhamazela futhi sikhanya. Ufaka incwadi ephaketheni ahlehle, kuyilapho abanye beya phambili."}],"created_by":"SmartBridge FET content team","is_published":true,"description":"Mixed grade revision drawn from the other two terms. Includes later-term topics; revisit after studying those topics. Questions are reused deliberately across revision sets.","quiz_type":"practice","difficulty_level":"medium","time_limit_minutes":12,"passing_score_percentage":50,"total_questions":5,"allow_retakes":true,"show_answers_after_submission":true,"tags":["CAPS","ATP","term-2","formative","zuhl"],"metadata":{"term":2,"focus":"Mixed revision: Ukukhethwa kwamagama nokushiywa kolwazi; Ukuhlaziya izincwadi ngokufunda ngokujulile","language":"zu","content_version":"2026-10-21.2","content_origin":"SmartBridge original","curriculum_year":2026,"atp_url":"https://www.education.gov.za/LinkClick.aspx?fileticket=72xm6LEbf4o%3d&tabid=3205&portalid=0&mid=10756","caps_url":"https://www.education.gov.za/LinkClick.aspx?fileticket=nZlas4HGdYI%3d&tabid=570&portalid=0&mid=1555","retention_circular_url":"https://www.education.gov.za/Portals/0/Documents/Publications/2026/Circulars/Circular%20S19%20of%202025%20and%20Annexures.pdf","verified_on":"2026-10-21","lesson_path":"/study-packs/zuhl-12","coverage":"Selected grade revision from other terms, including later-term content. Not a second paper covering only the selected term.","moderation_status":"Independent teacher and language moderation pending","term_note":"Revision included where specified by ATP; some Grade 10/11 Term 4 plans introduce new content.","set_id":"B","set_label":"Mixed grade revision","cognitive_framework":"CAPS language response: Barrett-informed comprehension and litera